{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Right to Bear Arms</strong> is a quirky <strong>souls-like action adventure</strong> in a simplistic <strong>cartoonish look</strong> that tells the story of <strong>Jacub</strong> and his friends who need to save the forest from the farm animals who threaten to take control of the last free enclave in  Abearica.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story like no other, where  Jacub, the protagonist, stumbles into a beer-induced adventure to save the <strong>freedom of the forest animals.<br><br>Fight for Freedom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/3a41824c6f362cd9cc6e5c29e8207a59.poster.avif?t=1750345974\" width=528 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/3a41824c6f362cd9cc6e5c29e8207a59.webm?t=1750345974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/3a41824c6f362cd9cc6e5c29e8207a59.mp4?t=1750345974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player you will work with an <strong>arsenal of weapons</strong> to defeat various enemies. <strong>Switch between your weapons</strong> on the go to match the situation you're in. Use the <strong>hunter's rifle</strong>, the <strong>lumberjack's axe</strong> or just your <i><strong>bear arms</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't forget you're not invincible during the slaughter! Use a <strong>Dodge Roll</strong> to escape dangerous attacks and keep the enemy at a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Abearica</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/6d61a1d4028ec7040fb62a9174b960c1.poster.avif?t=1750345974\" width=676 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/6d61a1d4028ec7040fb62a9174b960c1.webm?t=1750345974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/6d61a1d4028ec7040fb62a9174b960c1.mp4?t=1750345974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the deep <strong>Forests</strong> and what secrets might lay beyond them. On your path to Freedom you can collect <strong>Cans</strong> to grow your power and spread even more fear among the enemy.<br><br><br><br><strong>Play with your Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/8ea4808ffcf22ccc6a0be6034f7c1074.avif?t=1750345974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras_big/8ea4808ffcf22ccc6a0be6034f7c1074.avif?t=1750345974 width=800 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Right to Bear Arms offers a online <strong>Co-Op mode</strong> where you can <strong>play with up to 3 of your friends </strong>through Steam. In addition to more fire power, you will also be able to revive your friends in combat. Look out for mysterious white mushrooms, as they might <strong>show you the fate of other players.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3421000?t=1750345974","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3421000?t=1750345974","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/0be0f5a739cc58ba577a8ddfdb01d3d9bd673a26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750345974","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/0be0f5a739cc58ba577a8ddfdb01d3d9bd673a26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750345974","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3531440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Right to Bear Arms</strong> is a quirky <strong>souls-like action adventure</strong> in a simplistic <strong>cartoonish look</strong> that tells the story of <strong>Jacub</strong> and his friends who need to save the forest from the farm animals who threaten to take control of the last free enclave in  Abearica.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story like no other, where  Jacub, the protagonist, stumbles into a beer-induced adventure to save the <strong>freedom of the forest animals.<br><br>Fight for Freedom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/3a41824c6f362cd9cc6e5c29e8207a59.poster.avif?t=1750345974\" width=528 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/3a41824c6f362cd9cc6e5c29e8207a59.webm?t=1750345974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/3a41824c6f362cd9cc6e5c29e8207a59.mp4?t=1750345974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player you will work with an <strong>arsenal of weapons</strong> to defeat various enemies. <strong>Switch between your weapons</strong> on the go to match the situation you're in. Use the <strong>hunter's rifle</strong>, the <strong>lumberjack's axe</strong> or just your <i><strong>bear arms</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't forget you're not invincible during the slaughter! Use a <strong>Dodge Roll</strong> to escape dangerous attacks and keep the enemy at a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Abearica</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/6d61a1d4028ec7040fb62a9174b960c1.poster.avif?t=1750345974\" width=676 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/6d61a1d4028ec7040fb62a9174b960c1.webm?t=1750345974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/6d61a1d4028ec7040fb62a9174b960c1.mp4?t=1750345974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the deep <strong>Forests</strong> and what secrets might lay beyond them. On your path to Freedom you can collect <strong>Cans</strong> to grow your power and spread even more fear among the enemy.<br><br><br><br><strong>Play with your Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras/8ea4808ffcf22ccc6a0be6034f7c1074.avif?t=1750345974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/extras_big/8ea4808ffcf22ccc6a0be6034f7c1074.avif?t=1750345974 width=800 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Right to Bear Arms offers a online <strong>Co-Op mode</strong> where you can <strong>play with up to 3 of your friends </strong>through Steam. In addition to more fire power, you will also be able to revive your friends in combat. Look out for mysterious white mushrooms, as they might <strong>show you the fate of other players.</strong></p>","developers":["Bear Bones Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421000/header.jpg?t=1750345974","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3421000/1852646316/cfa1f08f245211263beabb64b26b5528b6084c2c/1750344817/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750345970","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3421000/1852646316/cfa1f08f245211263beabb64b26b5528b6084c2c/1750344817/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750345970","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3421000/1852646316/cfa1f08f245211263beabb64b26b5528b6084c2c/1750344817/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750345970","id":257158808,"name":"The Right To Bear Arms - First Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158808/e1cd9ed9313d48363ca25fe77effdc14699b4a02/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750345970"}],"name":"The Right to Bear Arms","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"